    "id": 3003005010370,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "早く会いたくなっちゃって！\r\nね、事務所まで一緒に行こっ？",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru2",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300300501/3003005010370"
  },
  {
    "id": 3003005010380,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "…………うん",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hiori2",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300300501/3003005010380"
  },
  {
    "id": 3003005010390,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "……やっぱり、めぐるにはかなわないな",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hiori2",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300300501/3003005010390"
  },
  {
    "id": 3003005010400,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "えー、何がー？　──って、あーっ！",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "meguru2",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300300501/3003005010400"
  },
  {
    "id": 3003005010410,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "ど、どうしたの？",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "hiori2",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300300501/3003005010410"
  },
  {
    "id": 3003005010420,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "せっかくなら真乃も誘ってくればよかった！\r\n真乃も灯織と話したがってたのに～……！",
    "charAnim1": "wait",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "meguru2",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300300501/3003005010420"
  },
  {
    "id": 3003005010430,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "ううっ、うっかりしてたよー……！",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "meguru2",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300300501/3003005010430"
  },
  {
    "id": 3003005010440,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "……灯織灯織っ、事務所に着いたら、\r\n真乃ともいっぱい話してね！？　お願い！",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "meguru2",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300300501/3003005010440"
  },
  {
    "id": 3003005010450,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "……うん、私も真乃と話したいこといっぱいあるから",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "yes",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hiori2",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300300501/3003005010450",
    "charAnim2Loop": false
  },
  {
    "id": 3003005010460,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "そっか！　よかったぁ……！\r\n……えへへ、きっと、真乃も喜ぶよ",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru2",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300300501/3003005010460"
  },
  {
    "id": 3003005010470,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "そうそう真乃と言えば！　この間、\r\n真乃が剥いてくれたりんご見た？　うさちゃんのヤツ！",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru2",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300300501/3003005010470"
  },
  {
    "id": 3003005010480,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "あれ、真乃が剥いてくれたんだ……\r\n……うさぎ、上手だった",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "hiori2",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300300501/3003005010480"
  },
  {
    "id": 3003005010490,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "あんなふうにできちゃうなんて真乃って器用だよねーっ\r\nわたしにはできないもん",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru2",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300300501/3003005010490"
  },
  {
    "id": 3003005010500,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "今日もまたりんご剥いてもらおっか？\r\nそしたらみんなで食べれるし！　ね、灯織はどう思う？",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru2",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300300501/3003005010500"
  },
  {
    "id": 3003005010510,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "ふふ、今日のめぐる、なんかいつもより元気な気がする",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hiori2",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300300501/3003005010510"
  },
  {
    "id": 3003005010520,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "なになに？　わたしのこと？\r\nそれはそうだよ！　だって嬉しいから！",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru2",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300300501/3003005010520"
  },
  {
    "id": 3003005010530,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "……なんか、調子狂う",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_angry",
    "charLabel": "hiori2",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300300501/3003005010530"
  },
  {
    "id": 3003005010540,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "あっ、ちょっと灯織、待ってよー\r\nもう少しゆっくり話しながら行こうよー",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru2",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300300501/3003005010540"
  },
  {
    "id": 3003005010550,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "話なら、事務所に着いてからでもできるでしょ？",
